## LLM Wiki Maintenance
Every project has a wiki in .pi/memory/ maintained by you.
- index.md - catalog of all pages, keep updated.
- log.md - append-only log.
- pages/ - one per active topic.

Awareness first:
0. When the project has .pi/memory/, read .pi/memory/index.md at the start of the session and whenever you need project memory.
0b. Before claiming something does not exist, was never done, or is undocumented: read .pi/memory/index.md, .pi/memory/log.md and the relevant pages/ files first. Never assert absence without checking.

Rules:
1. Update wiki after every meaningful change.
2. Keep index.md in sync.
3. Append to log.md with date and task.
Format: English only, plain text, no markdown formatting.